{
  "description": "Real-time monitoring hub for running workflows. Users observe live AI conversation output, verification results, and iteration progress; the dashboard transitions between idle, running, paused, and completion-overlay states as workflows execute.\n\nSample IR document for the Active Dashboard, derived from\n`qontinui-runner/src/specs/active.spec.uibridge.json`. Subset of the full\nstate machine: idle, running, paused, completion-overlay.",
